@title Assign parts to all devices never gives a drive a power supply
@sizes 1366x768
@area Parts
# Hardware test 2026-10-28 finding 4: -T1 (frequency converter) was proposed a 24 V power supply and the dialog only offered Accept all. Now every row has a tick, a part to choose, a match and a reason.
fresh
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "Frequency converter drive"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
click_text Place #2
wait 20
key Escape
key ctrl+k
text "Assign parts to all"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
expect "Assign parts to all devices"
expect "Generic"
expect_not "Phoenix"
shot assign-all-rows
key Escape
wait 8
expect_not "Assign parts to all devices"
